{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Validate execution existence before creating a worker**\n\n`submit()` creates a daemon worker before `_set_paused()` loads the execution. For an unknown ARN, the task raises before worker teardown, leaving that lane registered; repeated unknown pause/resume calls therefore leak threads until runner shutdown. Call `get_execution()` before submitting in both public methods and add a test asserting the registry's active worker count is unchanged.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7-R4bF","finding_digest":"b06883edb6b92ca6edc8811e6a57457e9bb9ae91f04fe045182fdb6e7bcc9f63","finding_id":"arf_v1_wbuih3nwxewkn3oiqepguv2fp2","finding_key":"testing/executor.py::pause-resume::unknown-execution-worker-leak","identity_key":"testing/executor.py::pause-resume::unknown-execution-worker-leak","line":1836,"observation_digest":"85a9ac2cabd184cb4e13238dcfaf8f7e242cd9f9b63e44b19cfcbc9516ce3da1","observation_id":"aro_v1_qwu2ylfl2gcmwtqteog47l4ppy","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/executor.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_wbuih3nwxewkn3oiqepguv2fp2","published_at":"2026-10-14T02:19:49Z","review_id":"arr_v1_pqgh7hin6eqe3ngsxdb2httekc","reviewed_base_sha":"0ceaf045ad42a8ea779d9c5d4c3408ce9631d04b","reviewed_head_sha":"bc89ab751a0d99eb430c6aa00043aa24a5da0110","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1833,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":757},"record_id":"art_v1_y6jtj2m7z6vf2lho6qn6swrldb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T02:19:49Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
